                </p>

                <h5>KEY FEATURES</h5>
                <ul>
                    <li>Protection against damage caused by hairdryers, straighteners and other heat sources</li>
                    <li>Super-hydrating action to control frizz</li>
                    <li>Intense, natural shine</li>
                    <li>Soft, manageable and silky hair</li>
                </ul>
                <h5>RESULTS</h5>
                <p>Stronger, more supple and visibly shinier hair – the lightweight texture of Infusion Spray is perfect for everyday use.</p>
                <h5>HOW TO USE</h5>
                <p>
                    Spray onto the lengths and ends of wet hair before drying to protect it from heat.<br>
                    When applied to dry hair, it enhances shine and perfects the finish.
                </p>
